==Finnish==

===Etymology===
Originally a variant of {{m|fi|luokki}}. The meaning has abstracted from "shaft bow" → "group of things (attached with a shaft bow)" → "group, class". {{doublet|fi|lenkki|linkki}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fi-pronunciation}}

