{{fi-noun}}

# [[class]] {{gloss|group, collection, category or set sharing characteristics or attributes}}
# [[class]], [[social class]] {{gloss|social grouping, based on job, wealth, inheritance etc.}}
#: {{syn|fi|yhteiskuntaluokka}}
#: {{uxi|fi|'''luokka'''taistelu|'''class''' struggle}}
# [[class]] {{gloss|category of seats in an airplane, train or other means of mass transportation}}
#: {{uxi|fi|turisti'''luokka'''|economy '''class'''}}
#: {{uxi|fi|ensimmäinen '''luokka'''|first '''class'''}}
# [[grade]] {{gloss|level of pre-collegiate education}}
#: {{coi|fi|jättää '''luokalle'''|to [[retain]] {{gloss|hold back a student}}}}
#: {{coi|fi|jäädä '''luokalle'''|to be retained {{gloss|required to repeat a year}}}}
#: {{ux|fi|Hän on kahdeksannella '''luokalla'''.|He's in the eighth '''grade'''}}
# [[class]], [[school class]] {{gloss|group of pre-college students who regularly attend lectures together}}
# [[class]] {{gloss|group of students in a regularly scheduled meeting with a teacher}}
# {{lb|fi|by extension}} [[classroom]]
#: {{syn|fi|luokkahuone}}
# {{lb|fi|statistics}} [[class]] {{gloss|grouping of data values in an interval}}
# {{lb|fi|mathematics}} [[class]] {{gloss|collection of sets definable by a shared property}}
# {{lb|fi|taxonomy}} [[class]] {{gloss|below phylum and above order}}
# {{lb|fi|programming}} [[class]] {{gloss|set of objects possibly differing in state but not behavior}}
# {{alternative form of|fi|luokki||shaft bow}}.
# {{lb|fi|by extension|dialectal}} anything bent over
#: {{ux|fi|Ne oli ne puut ihan '''luokalla'''.|Those trees were all '''bent over'''.}}

